[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9857.389, "timestamp": "02:44:17", "text": "，滑板在哪裡？一旦你賺了很多錢。這邊。這邊。  這邊。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9859.79, "timestamp": "02:44:19", "text": "是什​​麼意思？你在哪裡？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9871.11, "timestamp": "02:44:31", "text": "呃，在前面，就在「是」的旁邊。是的。  好的。  我以為那是個槍的表情動作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9879.71, "timestamp": "02:44:39", "text": "什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9882.63, "timestamp": "02:44:42", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9884.67, "timestamp": "02:44:44", "text": "哦，那是垃圾。  好的。滑板。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9896.469, "timestamp": "02:44:56", "text": "嗯。是的。"}]